Not just any potion of levitation will do this.  The potion must be 
cursed.  If one quaffs an uncursed or blessed potion of levitation, one
does not bump one's head on the ceiling.  Blessed potions let you choose
for how many moves you wish to levitate (between 1 and 200 I believe).
